# libpcre2-8

`libpcre2-8` is the sole r10 owner of the public `libpcre2-8.so.0` runtime
SONAME.  It is rebuilt from the Buildroot 2025.02.1 PCRE2 recipe using the
locked source archive in `source.lock`; it does not ship headers, static
archives, executables, or the optional POSIX wrapper library.

GNU `grep` is the first consumer.  It declares both build- and runtime
dependencies on this exact provider so the candidate feed can retain
PCRE-compatible regular expressions without embedding a library in the
command package.
